// @openui "Agent Lifecycle"
root = Stack(
  [
    TextContent("**Goal Intake** — The user submits a natural-language goal. The orchestrator parses intent, identifies required capabilities, and selects relevant tools from the registry."),
    TextContent("**Context Retrieval** — The memory module performs a semantic search over stored embeddings to surface prior facts, tool outputs, or conversation history relevant to the current goal."),
    TextContent("**Planning** — The planner prompts the LLM with the goal plus retrieved context. The LLM returns an ordered action plan — either as structured JSON or a chain-of-thought trace."),
    TextContent("**Tool Execution** — The tool router dispatches each planned action to the executor. Tools include web search, code sandboxes, browser control, file I/O, and external APIs."),
    TextContent("**Evaluation & Loop** — The evaluator checks whether the execution result satisfies the success criteria. If not, it feeds failure context back to the orchestrator and triggers a new planning iteration."),
    TextContent("**Response Delivery** — Once the evaluator confirms success, the final artefact (answer, code diff, report) is formatted and returned to the user. Results are optionally persisted to memory."),
  ],
)
